This is a preliminary version of the larl compiler.

Source layout:

boot/                    The bootstrap compiler, written in OCaml
boot/fe                  - Front end (lexer, parser, AST)
boot/me                  - Middle end (resolve, type check)
boot/be                  - Back end (code generation)
boot/util                - Ubiquitous helpers (errors, positions, misc)
boot/driver              - Compiler driver (command line, runs fe -> me -> be)

lib/                     The standard library, written in larl

rt/                      The runtime system

test/                    Testsuite
test/compile-fail        - Tests that should fail to compile
test/run-fail            - Tests that should compile, run and fail
test/run-pass            - Tests that should compile, run and succeed
